  "description": "The SKE Crystal CL6000 Prefilled Pod Vape Kit is a state-of-the-art device designed for vapers who demand convenience, value and performance in one kit. The super-compact CL6000 combines portability with power, boasting a rechargeable 800mAh battery capable of delivering up to 6000 puffs per device. With USB-C fast charging, the battery recharges quickly, minimising downtime and keeping you vaping for longer. At the heart of the Crystal CL6000 is an innovative automatic e-liquid refill system that eliminates the need for manual refilling with the addition of a 10ml e-liquid reservoir. Each 2ml built-in pod uses advanced dual mesh coil technology to deliver enhanced flavour and a consistently smooth vaping experience. The combination of the automatic refill mechanism and leak-resistant design ensures every puff is satisfying and hassle-free. With its lightweight yet durable construction and that classic Crystal Bar translucent and colourful aesthetic, the Crystal CL6000 offers a comfortable grip and effortless portability. The kit is prefilled with 20mg/ml nicotine salt e-liquid, providing rapid nicotine relief and silky smooth yet satisfyingly tactile throat hits. Available in a variety of expertly crafted flavours, from refreshing fruit blends to icy favourites, the SKE Crystal CL6000 is ideal for vapers seeking ultimate convenience without compromising on taste or performance. Available SKE Crystal CL6000 Flavours: Blue Razz Lemonade: A tangy fusion of rich, sweet blue raspberry and zesty lemonade for a vibrant vape. Blueberry Raspberries: A juicy blend of ripe blueberries and tart raspberries for an authentic, balanced fruity burst of flavour. Blueberry Sour Raspberry: A bold combination of sweet blueberry and sour raspberry with a sharp, tangy twist. Cherry Ice: The taste of sweet, succulent cherries finished with an icy, cool exhale. Fizzy Cherry: Fresh and fruity cherry soda flavour with a lively, sparkling finish. Lemon and Lime: A classic zesty combo of sharp lemon and refreshing lime for a citrusy kick. Pink Lemonade: A sweet and tangy blend of citrus lemonade layered with soft red berries. Sour Pineapple: A tropical burst of rich, tangy pineapple with a bold, sour twist. Strawberry Burst: Soft, ripe strawberries delivering a classic smooth, sweet vape. Watermelon Ice: Juicy watermelon paired with a refreshing, icy menthol finish. Simply select your preferred flavour and enjoy a long-lasting, flavourful and satisfying vape experience with the SKE Crystal CL6000. Please Note: USB-C Cable Sold Separately Shop SKE Crystal CL6000 Refill Pods",
